rrect answer is acceptable. For example, if  \"bcbc\", we can either remove 'b' at index  or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229438,"global_rank":113718,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19718},{"name":"nonabelian/leapy","owner":"nonabelian","html_url":"https://github.com/nonabelian/leapy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"BETA: Real-time inference from scalable machine learning in Python","topics":["dask","dask-ml","data-science","inference","machine-learning","pipeline","pipelines","real-time","realtime"],"score":229433,"global_rank":231577,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19719},{"name":"ephraimrothschild/Neural-Network-Tools","owner":"ephraimrothschild","html_url":"https://github.com/ephraimrothschild/Neural-Network-Tools","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A generic implementation of a Neural Network using a backpropagation algorithm that can be used for any kind for vector-represented data.","topics":[],"score":229432,"global_rank":113723,"on_p